  "notes": [
    "Parser-quality guidance respected: structured table CSV/markdown not used as primary evidence; counts were read from page text and cross-checked against page images for pages 4, 10, 11 and 16.",
    "Table 8 recomputed against 700 579 listings: 266 625 = 38.06%, 433 954 = 61.94%, 93 786 = 13.39%, 75 644 = 10.80%, 74 861 = 10.69%, 68 974 = 9.84%, 26 811 = 3.83%, 6 751 = 0.96%; Any + No = 700 579. The by-type rows are not exhaustive shares (the note says they do not add to the total), so no adding-up test applies.",
    "Table 3 and Table 4 cells sum correctly (3+0=3; 1+30=31; 4+30=34; 33/34 = 97.06%). The 31 not-relevant pilot-coder articles equal 21 not relevant + 8 unclear + 2 pre-opening Homborsund articles.",
    "Table 7 counts (read from the page-11 image) were checked against the 44-project denominator and the text 'between a third and a half'. Two groups (23 and 24 of 44) are slightly above half and one (4) well below a third; 'most of the other groups' covers this, so no finding.",
    "Table 5 road-link intervals (0–1492 m + 0–641 m = 2 133 m) against reported length 2 132 m is rounding-compatible and was not reported.",
    "Unverified external numbers (not checkable from retained evidence): Copenhagen 60 percent, Fyhri et al. up to five percentage points, Bartik et al. 96 percent accuracy. The national 38.1% could not be tested against county shares without county listing counts."
  ],
